objective-condition-title-intel = Collect valuable intel
objective-condition-description-intel = The Spider Clan deals not just in tech, but information. Technological secrets, classified data, blackmail material, personal information, how the captain likes their coffee; if you can collect it, we can use it.
objective-condition-title-lawset = Tamper with the Station AI lawset
objective-condition-description-lawset = One of our research teams is studying silicon law, and they want you to gather some data. Download an unconventional lawset, and we'll observe its behavior.
objective-condition-title-announcement = Make a public announcement
objective-condition-description-announcement = You've come to make an announcement... Make sure they hear it.
objective-condition-title-tsujigiri = Perform Tsujigiri
objective-condition-description-tsujigiri = You’ve been given a brand new blade. Test its effectiveness on a defenseless passer-by. We’d rather you not render them unrecoverable, however.
objective-condition-title-kindness = Help someone in need
objective-condition-description-kindness = Public relations have been in the dumps ever since the… incident. Perform an act of kindness to prove the Spider Clan is more than bloodthirsty monsters.
objective-condition-title-capital = Gather a large amount of capital for the Spider Clan
objective-condition-description-capital = The Spider Clan is going to default on its loans soon, and we need capital. Bring back spesos, precious metals, or anything else we can easily liquidate.
objective-condition-title-humiliate = Humiliate the enemy
objective-condition-description-humiliate = The enemy has been allowed to believe they hold a candle to our greatness for far too long. Show the Spider Clan's superiority over the Syndicate, Wizard's Federation, or the Brotherhood, whoever is present.
